3
00:00:05.010 --> 00:00:06.913
So let's take a look at this clip.

4
00:00:08.340 --> 00:00:09.173
Hi, Drew.

5
00:00:09.173 --> 00:00:10.120 line:15%
My name's Rachael.

6
00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:13.730 line:15%
I live in Lynnwood, Washington, and I'm 46 years old.

7
00:00:13.730 --> 00:00:15.510
I have a son that's 17,

8
00:00:15.510 --> 00:00:18.180
and this fall, he'll be heading off to college.

9
00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:19.917
I've been divorced for about 10 years,

10
00:00:19.917 --> 00:00:23.670
and I am very interested in prioritizing dating.

11
00:00:23.670 --> 00:00:26.730
I have recently lost over 120 pounds

12
00:00:26.730 --> 00:00:29.740
and I am very excited to meet new people.

13
00:00:29.740 --> 00:00:33.000
My hope is that Damona can help me with advice

14
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:35.590
on how to take on my next first date.

15
00:00:35.590 --> 00:00:39.500
First dates are first impressions and it always counts.

16
00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:41.500
I could really use some advice.

17
00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:43.264
Could you help me?

18
00:00:43.264 --> 00:00:45.008
She's doing the right thing.

19
00:00:45.008 --> 00:00:45.841
Absolutely.

20
00:00:45.841 --> 00:00:47.240
(audience applauds)

21
00:00:47.240 --> 00:00:50.283
Please welcome, someone I totally relate to, Rachael.

22
00:00:51.230 --> 00:00:52.631
Hi, Rachael.
Hi.

23
00:00:52.631 --> 00:00:55.631
(audience applauds)

24
00:00:57.020 --> 00:01:00.211
Okay, Rachael, what scares you the most

25
00:01:00.211 --> 00:01:02.410
